    "title": "Football World - Real People",
    "description": "Football World is a fun and addictive game that lets you play against other real players worldwide. Choose from a variety of tiers and stadiums, and customize your players with different skills and abilities. \r\n\r\nWith stunning graphics and smooth gameplay, Football World is the perfect soccer game for fans of all ages. The football game (Soccer game) is free to download and play\r\n\r\n<b> Key Features of Football World</b>\r\n\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Play against other real players from around the world \r\n\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Stunning graphics and smooth gameplay\r\n\r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Customize your players with different skills and abilities.\r\n\r\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Choose from a variety of stadiums\r\n\r\n5\ufe0f\u20e3  Upgrade your player attributes and take on the world\u2019s best gamers online \r\n\r\n<b> Gameplay & Rewards </b>\r\n\r\nSwipe with your finger on the screen in a direction to kick the ball from the shooting point \r\n\r\nCurve the ball with a swipe to score shots in difficult ranges \r\n\r\nEnjoy real-time multiplayer football with your friends\r\n\r\nCollect unique kit bags and coins after winning matches\r\n\r\nTop in the daily or weekly leaderboard of Football World\r\n\r\nJoin millions of Football (soccer) fans worldwide and become the ultimate penalty shootout hero in Football World: Online Soccer free to play game. \r\n\r\nDownload now for free and experience the excitement of every strike and save!\r\n\r\nLike us on Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/football_world_game_/\r\n\r\nYouTube- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbF5CymoGICl2ZvMs8OK9_g",
